bake-codemode includes code ported from the following MIT-licensed projects,
and embeds a WebAssembly binary built from them. Bake's own changes are under
the workspace's MIT license.

================================================================================
Pi (packages/codemode and packages/coding-agent)
https://github.com/earendil-works/pi
Release v1.3.0, revision 71023aec1546d6d677a65669c5665c0927ce0dd0.
Ported: the VM driver contract of packages/codemode/src/runtime/vm.ts (job
batches, stall detection, deterministic mode and its fingerprint), the host
decoding and checks of src/runtime/execution.ts, the messages of
src/runtime/protocol.ts, the source format of src/source.ts, the declarations
of src/declarations.ts, src/identifier.ts, and the types of src/types.ts, with
the cases of test/sandbox.test.ts, test/deterministic.test.ts,
test/declarations.test.ts, test/source.test.ts, and
test/worker-lifetime.test.ts; the BM25 tool-search ranker of
packages/coding-agent/src/extensions/tool-search/tool.ts with its cases in
test/tool-search.test.ts. assets/prelude.js is the text of
src/runtime/prelude-source.ts, copied verbatim with this notice.
Not ported: the worker, inline, remote, and Cloudflare sandboxes and their
transports, the Lark grammar, and the tool_search tool.
